-- 005: Shoot 1 for Jatin = the 14-question questionnaire set (cards + drive prompts).
-- Safe to run more than once. Answers already given stay attached by card id.
update rounds r set config = '{"lede":"We wrote your story from what we already know. You just tell us where we got it wrong. Thumbs only, no typing.","intro":"Each card is one line of the story we plan to build. Nothing here is public yet, and a yes on a card is not a yes to post it.","secondsPerPrompt":75,"cards":[{"id":"name","claim":"Six months from now, when someone in the West talks real estate, your name comes up first.","why":"That is the whole job. Recall, then trust. If there is something else you want people to remember after a few videos, say it on the mic."},{"id":"who","claim":"The people you most want are first-home buyers and upgrading families in Melbourne''s North and West.","why":"Truganina and around is the heart of it. If you know the decision they are stuck on and what they cannot find in an agent, tell us in a voice note."},{"id":"community","claim":"You are at home with the Indian community, but the brand talks to everyone in the West.","why":"Comfortable there, not boxed in there."},{"id":"proof","claim":"The numbers go first. 130-plus homes sold in a year, most as lead agent, five stars from over a hundred reviews.","why":"Results speak before introductions."},{"id":"start","claim":"The story starts with the Uber years. You came to Australia, drove, did odd jobs, got into real estate and grew fast.","why":"The contrast is the hook. We tell it with your words, not ours. The turning point itself, you tell us on the drive."},{"id":"office","claim":"The Truganina office is part of the story. There is a standard you want the team known for.","why":"One detail from the space, or one thing the people there should be known for. Say it on the mic if there is one."},{"id":"line","claim":"Nothing is promised in three months. That line still holds.","why":"Say what it means to you and the experience behind it. If it no longer reflects your thinking, tap Not quite and tell us what you would say today."},{"id":"voice","claim":"You talk calm and straight. Hindi, Punjabi or English, whatever the client speaks.","why":"The captions and voiceovers will sound like that too. A few phrases you actually use with clients, and any words that feel unlike you, on the mic."},{"id":"camera","claim":"You would rather be heard than perform. Voiceover-led reels, you on screen when it adds weight, never a put-on accent.","why":"We build your comfort slowly. No scripts to memorise."},{"id":"format","claim":"Talking to a client feels more natural than talking to a lens. Conversations and walkthroughs first, direct to camera later.","why":"If there are two or three accounts or videos you enjoy, any industry, name them on the mic. What works there, and what would feel forced on you."},{"id":"lifestyle","claim":"The car and the watch show up in the background. They are never the point.","why":"Polished Jatin, not manufactured Jatin."},{"id":"family","claim":"Family stays off camera unless you say otherwise.","why":"Off limits by default. Anything else that should stay private, say it here or on the last drive prompt."},{"id":"rhythm","claim":"Stories almost every day, 12 to 15 reels a month, and you check with us before reposting anything.","why":"That is the operating rhythm from day one."}],"prompts":[{"q":"The moment real estate became serious for you.","h":"One turning point. Then how it still shows up in the way you work."},{"q":"A deal or a client decision that got difficult.","h":"What was at stake, what you did, what happened. A trade-off, or something you could not control."},{"q":"The experience that changed how you take responsibility.","h":"For a client or the team. If working with Ravi is part of it, what you learned and what you do differently now."},{"q":"A working day people rarely see.","h":"A recent one. What happened before or after the inspections, calls or auctions. A moment your judgment mattered."},{"q":"A client moment that shows what you bring.","h":"A key handover, a hard conversation, a referral. What you did and any feedback you actually got."},{"q":"Optional. A setback that changed how you work.","h":"Only the part you are comfortable with, and what changed after. Tap Next to skip."},{"q":"Optional. An early moment in Melbourne that explains who you are today.","h":"Belonging, ambition, finding your place. Leave it out if it feels too personal. Tap Next to skip."},{"q":"What should stay private.","h":"Family, history, opinions, filming situations you do not want. Say background only for anything we should hear but never use."}],"shootOptions":["Sat 15 Nov","Tue 18 Nov","Sat 22 Nov"],"photoAsks":["A photo of a listing we could film at","A photo of your desk at the Truganina office"]}'::jsonb
from clients c where r.client_id = c.id and c.slug = 'jatin' and r.number = 1;
